arxiv-2511-08679.description:
A 2025 arXiv research paper by Muon and Tau Flavor Violation. We revisit the minimal type II seesaw mechanism generating the Majorana neutrino mass matrix M ν M^{
u} , under the assumption that two entries of M ν M^{
u} vanish. Such flavor structures are known as two-zero textures. Processes with charged lepton flavor violation (CLFV), absent in the Standard Model (SM), can have sizable rates in this framework and are directly linked to the flavor structure of M ν M^{
u} .
